      "t": "SpaceX Is Hiring in Natural Gas Trading for Energy Needs",
      "d": "Elon Musk’s SpaceX is hiring a trader to build and lead a natural gas trading team to support the space flight company’s growing fuel and power needs.",
      "u": "https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-08-21/spacex-is-hiring-for-natural-gas-trading-to-support-energy-needs",
      "m": "08. 21. PM 07:53",
      "ts": 1787341980000,
      "fullText": "Technology SpaceX Is Hiring in Natural Gas Trading for Energy Needs Facebook X LinkedIn Email Link Gift Expand A SpaceX Falcon 9 reusable rocket booster outside the company's facilities in Hawthorne, California. Photographer: Ethan Swope/Bloomberg Facebook X LinkedIn Email Link Gift Gift this article Contact us: Provide news feedback or report an error Confidential tip? Send a tip to our reporters Site feedback: Take our Survey New Window Facebook X LinkedIn Email Link Gift By Julian Hast August 21, 2026 at 7:53 PM UTC Updated on August 21, 2026 at 8:48 PM UTC Bookmark Save Elon Musk’s SpaceX is hiring a trader to build and lead a natural gas trading team to support the space flight company’s growing fuel and power needs. Job postings for the role, which “focuses on physical and financial natural gas trading,” further underscores the importance of the power-plant and manufacturing fuel to support the company’s ambitions in chipmaking and space exploration."
    },
